---
/* An agent asks through MCP; the structure change waits for a person. */
---

<div class="av">
	<div class="card chat">
		<div class="top">
			<span class="agent">✦</span>
			<b>Agent</b>
			<span class="via">connecté par MCP · jeton « Ventes »</span>
		</div>
		<div class="msgs">
			<div class="msg user">Combien d’opportunités en négociation, et pour quel montant ?</div>
			<div class="tool">
				<code>list_records</code>
				<span>opportunites · statut = Négociation</span>
			</div>
			<div class="msg bot">
				Deux opportunités, <b>182 000 €</b> au total : Migration ERP (130 000 €) et Suivi de flotte (52 000 €).
			</div>
			<div class="msg user">Ajoute un champ « Probabilité » en pourcentage.</div>
			<div class="tool">
				<code>propose_add_field</code>
				<span>opportunites · Probabilité · number</span>
			</div>
			<div class="msg bot">C’est proposé : une personne de l’équipe doit l’approuver dans basedb.</div>
		</div>
	</div>

	<div class="card proposal">
		<div class="p-top">
			<span class="badge">Proposition</span>
			<span class="exp">expire dans 23 h</span>
		</div>
		<p class="what">Ajouter le champ <b>« Probabilité »</b> (Nombre) à <b>Opportunités</b></p>
		<p class="by">Proposée par l’agent · jeton « Ventes »</p>
		<div class="actions">
			<span class="btn ghost">Refuser</span>
			<span class="btn">Approuver</span>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>

<style>
	.av {
		position: relative;
		padding-bottom: 120px;
	}
	.card {
		border-radius: 14px;
		border: 1px solid var(--bd-border);
		background: #fff;
		box-shadow: 0 18px 40px -22px rgba(16, 24, 16, 0.3);
	}
	.chat {
		margin-right: 56px;
		overflow: hidden;
	}
	.top {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 8px;
		padding: 11px 14px;
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--bd-border-subtle);
		font-size: 13px;
	}
	.agent {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		width: 22px;
		height: 22px;
		border-radius: 6px;
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, #7c3aed, #2563eb);
		color: #fff;
		font-size: 11px;
	}
	.via {
		margin-left: auto;
		font-size: 11.5px;
		color: var(--bd-muted-fg);
	}
	.msgs {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 9px;
		padding: 14px;
		font-size: 13px;
		line-height: 1.5;
	}
	.msg {
		max-width: 84%;
		padding: 8px 12px;
		border-radius: 12px;
	}
	.msg.user {
		align-self: flex-end;
		background: var(--bd-ink);
		color: #eef6ec;
		border-bottom-right-radius: 4px;
	}
	.msg.bot {
		align-self: flex-start;
		background: var(--bd-muted);
		color: var(--bd-text);
		border-bottom-left-radius: 4px;
	}
	.tool {
		align-self: flex-start;
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 8px;
		font-size: 11.5px;
		color: var(--bd-muted-fg);
		border: 1px dashed var(--bd-border);
		border-radius: 8px;
		padding: 5px 9px;
	}
	.tool code {
		color: #7c3aed;
		font-weight: 600;
	}
	.proposal {
		position: absolute;
		right: 0;
		bottom: 0;
		width: min(88%, 380px);
		padding: 14px 16px;
		box-shadow: 0 30px 60px -24px rgba(16, 24, 16, 0.4);
		border-color: #cfe9c8;
	}
	.p-top {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: space-between;
	}
	.badge {
		font-size: 11px;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: 0.04em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: var(--bd-primary);
		background: var(--bd-primary-soft);
		padding: 3px 8px;
		border-radius: 999px;
	}
	.exp {
		font-size: 11.5px;
		color: var(--bd-muted-fg);
	}
	.what {
		margin: 10px 0 2px;
		font-size: 14px;
	}
	.by {
		margin: 0 0 12px;
		font-size: 12px;
		color: var(--bd-muted-fg);
	}
	.actions {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: flex-end;
		gap: 8px;
	}
	.btn {
		font-size: 12.5px;
		font-weight: 600;
		padding: 6px 12px;
		border-radius: 8px;
		background: var(--bd-primary);
		color: #fff;
	}
	.btn.ghost {
		background: #fff;
		color: var(--bd-text-soft);
		border: 1px solid var(--bd-border);
	}
</style>
